","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":24,"width":208,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":48,"width":350,"height":144},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"廣い門の下には、この男の外に誰もゐない。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":48,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"唯、所々丹塗の剝げた、大きな圓柱に、蟋蟀が","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":72,"width":336,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"一匹とまつてゐる。羅生門が、朱雀大路にある","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":96,"width":336,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"以上は、この男の外にも、雨やみをする市女笠","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":120,"width":336,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"や揉烏帽子が、もう二三人はありさうなもので","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":144,"width":336,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"ある。それが、この男の外には誰もゐない。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":168,"width":320,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":192,"width":350,"height":360},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"何故かと云ふと、この二三年、京都には、地震","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":192,"width":336,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"とか辻風とか火事とか饑饉とか云ふ災がつゞい","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":216,"width":336,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"て起つた。そこで洛中のさびれ方は一通りでな","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":240,"width":336,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"い。舊記によると、佛像や佛具を打碎いて、そ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":264,"width":336,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"の丹がついたり、金銀の箔がついたりした木","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":288,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"を、路ばたにつみ重ねて、薪の料に賣つてゐた","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":312,"width":336,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"と云ふ事である。洛中がその始末であるから、","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":336,"width":336,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"羅生門の修理などは、元より誰も捨てゝ顧る者","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":360,"width":336,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"がなかつた。するとその荒れ果てたのをよい事","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":384,"width":336,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"にして、狐狸が棲む。盜人が棲む。とうとうし","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":408,"width":336,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"まひには、引取り手のない死人を、この門へ持","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":432,"width":336,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"つて來て、棄てゝ行くと云ふ習慣さへ出來た。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":456,"width":336,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"そこで、日の目が見えなくなると、誰でも氣味","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":480,"width":336,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"を惡るがつて、この門の近所へは足ぶみをしな","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":504,"width":336,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"い事になつてしまつたのである。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":528,"width":240,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":552,"width":350,"height":360},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"その代り又鴉が何處からか、たくさん集つて來","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":552,"width":336,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"た。晝間見ると、その鴉が何羽となく輪を描い","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":576,"width":336,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"て高い鴟尾のまはりを啼きながら、飛びまはつ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":600,"width":336,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"てゐる。殊に門の上の空が、夕燒けであかくな","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":624,"width":336,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"る時には、それが胡麻をまいたやうにはつきり","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":648,"width":336,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"見えた。鴉は、勿論、門の上にある死人の肉","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":672,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"を、啄みに來るのである。――尤も今日は、刻","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":696,"width":336,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"限が遲いせいか、一羽も見えない。唯、所々、","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":720,"width":336,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"崩れかゝつた、さうしてその崩れ目に長い草の","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":744,"width":336,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"はへた石段の上に、鴉の糞が、點々と白くこび","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":768,"width":336,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"りついてゐるのが見える。下人は七段ある石段","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":792,"width":336,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"の一番上の段に洗ひざらした紺の襖の尻を据ゑ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":816,"width":336,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"て、右の頰に出來た、大きな面皰を氣にしなが","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":840,"width":336,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"ら、ぼんやり、雨のふるのを眺めてゐるのであ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":864,"width":336,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"る。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":888,"width":32,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":912,"width":350,"height":480},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"作者はさつき、「下人が雨やみを待つてゐた」","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":912,"width":336,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"と書いた。しかし、下人は、雨がやんでも格別","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":936,"width":336,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"どうしようと云ふ當てはない。ふだんなら、勿","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":960,"width":336,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"論、主人の家へ歸る可き筈である。所がその主","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":984,"width":336,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"人からは、四五日前に暇を出された。前にも書","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1008,"width":336,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"いたやうに、當時京都の町は一通りならず衰微","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1032,"width":336,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"してゐた。今この下人が、永年、使はれてゐた","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1056,"width":336,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"主人から、暇を出されたのも、この衰微の小さ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1080,"width":336,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"な餘波に外ならない。だから「下人が雨やみを","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1104,"width":336,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"待つてゐた」と云ふよりも、「雨にふりこめら","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1128,"width":336,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"れた下人が、行き所がなくて、途方にくれてゐ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1152,"width":336,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"た」と云ふ方が、適當である。その上、今日の","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1176,"width":336,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"空模樣も少からずこの平安朝の下人の ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1200,"width":272,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"Sentimentalisme に影響した。申の刻下りから","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1224,"width":338.78,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"ふり出した雨は、未に上るけしきがない。そこ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1248,"width":336,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"で、下人は、何を措いても差當り明日の暮しを","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1272,"width":336,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"どうにかしようとして――云はゞどうにもなら","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1296,"width":336,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"ない事を、どうにかしようとして、とりとめも","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1320,"width":336,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"ない考へをたどりながら、さつきから朱雀大路","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1344,"width":336,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"にふる雨の音を、聞くともなく聞いてゐた。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1368,"width":320,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":1392,"width":350,"height":96},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"雨は、羅生門をつゝんで、遠くから、ざあつと","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1392,"width":336,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"云ふ音をあつめて來る。夕闇は次第に空を低く","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1416,"width":336,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"して、見上げると、門の屋根が、斜につき出し","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1440,"width":336,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"た甍の先に、重たくうす暗い雲を支へてゐる。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1464,"width":336,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":1488,"width":350,"height":336},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"どうにもならない事を、どうにかする爲には、","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1488,"width":336,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"手段を選んでゐる遑はない。選んでゐれば、築","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1512,"width":336,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"土の下か、道ばたの土の上で、饑死をするばか","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1536,"width":336,"height":24}]}},{"